# Handoff

When a feature or slice is finished, stop and tell the user. They start a new agent from `HANDOFF.md`. Do not keep working in the same chat.

A commit is not automatically a handoff. Each commit, decide whether the slice is done enough for a new agent. If it is, say so.

`HANDOFF.md` is the only handoff document. Replace it. Do not append history. Keep it short.

